+## What changed
+
+- `src/truncate.mjs` (new): exports `truncate(text, max)`. Text of at most `max`
+  characters comes back unchanged; longer text is cut to `max - 1` characters and
+  ended with "…" (U+2026), so the result is exactly `max` characters long. A
+  non-string `text` throws a `TypeError`; a `max` that is not a positive integer
