+
+## Decisions on points the task leaves open
+
+- Boundary: text of exactly `max` characters is returned unchanged (`<=`).
+- `max` of 1: over-long text becomes just "…".
+- Whitespace: not trimmed; the cut is a plain slice, so trailing spaces before
+  the ellipsis are kept.
+- Characters are counted with `String.prototype.length`, as `padStart` does.
